# Pairs with LinkedClearsIntent. Linking does not retire the pending link intent,
# which would be replayed against an already linked sibling.
MODULE: LinkedClearsIntentLinkKeepsIntent
TARGET: LinkedClearsIntent
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the pending intent survives a successful link
PERTURBS: Link

--- FIND
    /\ linked' = TRUE /\ pending' = FALSE /\ held' = FALSE
    /\ UNCHANGED <<rowsD, rowsS, acked, phase, born, chained, marker, crashes>>
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the intent is never retired.
    /\ linked' = TRUE /\ held' = FALSE
    /\ UNCHANGED <<rowsD, rowsS, acked, phase, born, chained, pending, marker, crashes>>
--- END
